The '''Bank''' is a location in the {{zone|Village}} where the {{NPCSprite|Banker}} resides. Talking to them will allow the [[Player]] to make interactions with their account, including withdrawals and deposits as well as allowing the [[Player]] to interact with their [[Personal Vault]].

{{ZoneText
|Talk to the Banker.
|Store your &6coins&f to keep them safe.
|Earn interest on your &6coins&f.}}

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Banking System ==
Right-clicking a {{NPCSprite|Banker}} will open the {{zone|Bank}} interface. The player will be presented with the following options:
* [[File:Chest.png|26px|link=]] Deposit {{C}}
** Options available while depositing {{C}}: depositing the whole [[purse]], half the purse, or any specific amount.
* [[File:Dispenser.png|26px|link=]] Withdraw {{C}}
** There are four options available while withdrawing {{C}}: withdrawing everything on the account, half the account, {{Green|20%}} of the account, or a specific amount.
* [[File:Map.png|26px|link=]] Transaction History
** Hovering over the map will display information about the last {{green|10}} transactions done by the player and their co-op members, including the amount deposited/withdrawn/gained-with-interest and the time since.
* [[File:Block of Gold.png|26px|link=]] Bank Upgrades
** This option is not initially visible and is only unlocked after the player has at least {{C|10,000,000}} in their bank at once for the first time.
At the end of every in-game season (31 hours), the player receives interest on their stored {{C}}.

The first time you deposit coins in the bank, you get {{gold|10}} free {{coins}}, for finishing the [[Banker|Saving Up]] quest.

{{C|alt=Coins}} stored in the Bank are not lost when the player [[Death|dies]].

=== Bank Upgrades and Interest ===
Players are able to upgrade their bank account with {{C}} and {{Item|Enchanted Gold Block}}s after meeting the respective requirement in the [[Gold]] Collection. Upgrading the [[Bank]] account increases the maximum amount of {{C}} able to be stored in the bank, and increases the maximum interest able to be gained for all players on the profile. Upgrading Bank accounts also rewards {{SkyBlock Experience}}.

At least {{C|10m}} must be stored in the bank and the [[purse]] combined before the upgrade screen is unlocked.

Players also earn Interest that's proportional to their Account and the amount of stored {{c}}. It can be further increased through [[Museum Milestones]].
Note: Interest is applied in brackets. As an example, if a player has {{c|15,000,000}} in a Starter Account, interest would be applied in the following manner:
* {{Green|2%}} interest is applied to the {{c|10,000,000}} (for {{c|200,000}})
* {{Green|1%}} interest is applied to the next {{c|5,000,000}} spanning from {{Green|10}} to {{Green|15}} million (for {{c|50,000}})
