For players in a [[co-op]], their Personal Bank account (not to be confused with {{Item|Personal Bank}}) also scales with the profile's Bank Upgrades.

The balance limit and the increments for interest are {{Green|1/5th}} of the Co-op Bank Account. The specific values are:

* '''Starter:''' {{Coins|10m|short=y}} balance limit, {{Green|2%}} interest on first {{Coins|2m|s=y}}
* '''Gold:''' {{Coins|20m|s=y}} balance limit, {{Green|1%}} interest between {{Coins|2m|4m|s=y}}
* '''Deluxe:''' {{Coins|50m|s=y}} balance limit, {{Green|0.5%}} interest between {{Coins|4m|6m|s=y}}
* '''Super Deluxe:''' {{Coins|100m|s=y}} balance limit, {{Green|0.2%}} interest between {{Coins|6m|10m|s=y}}
* '''Premier:''' {{Coins|200m|s=y}} balance limit, {{Green|0.1%}} interest between {{Coins|10m|32m|s=y}}
* '''Luxurious:''' {{Coins|1.2b|s=y}} balance limit, {{Green|0.01%}} interest between {{Coins|32m|1.032b|s=y}}
* '''Palatial:''' {{Coins|12b|s=y}} balance limit, {{Green|0.001%}} interest between {{Coins|1.032b|11.032b|s=y}}

In order to fully upgrade the Bank account, a total of {{c|390,000,000}} and {{Item|Enchanted Gold Block|amount=376}}s ({{BazaarPurchaseCalc|Enchanted Gold Block,376}}{{BazaarInfoIcon}}) are required.

