== Locations ==
The '''Bank''' can be accessed through {{NPCSprite|Banker}} NPC in {{zone|Village}}, or their equivalents:
* {{NPCSprite|Banker Barry}} in {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}}
* {{NPCSprite|Banker Bonsai}} in {{Zone|Tangleburg Bank}}
* {{NPCSprite|Banker Broadjaw}} in {{Zone|Dwarven Village}}
* {{NPCSprite|Belanor}} in {{zone|Scarleton}}
* {{NPCSprite|Bruto}} in {{zone|Dragontail}}

The Bank can also be accessed by the [[Player]] even when they are not at any of its physical locations. The {{coll|Emerald 6}} rewards the [[Personal Bank Upgrade]], which allows the [[Player]] to interact with the bank through the [[SkyBlock Menu]] or a physical item. The NPC {{NPCSprite|Guy}} lowers the cooldown of this from {{green|1 hour}} all the way down to {{green|instantaneous}}. This cooldown refreshes when talking to any of the Banker NPCs. 

