== Trivia ==
<!--* Even though the Bank has a Vault (made of [[Iron]] blocks), the structure's architecture makes it impossible for it to contain anything inside it. This is confirmed by the fact that all of the Bank's [[Gold]] is scattered on the shelves, strewn outside of the bank, and even stored on the roof.-->
<!-- * A full bank at the starter level makes 8,064 coins in interest per hour. Depending on market conditions this is about equal to 2 minion slots, which makes banking coins a viable alternative to unlocking more slots later in the game. As a rule of thumb, if a new slot would cost more than 5m to unlock and the bank is below the interest cap, the player is better off banking instead of getting more slots. This doesn't consider skill XP or collection unlocks from minions, however.-->
* Assuming max interest and a cost of {{C|200k}} per {{Item|Enchanted Gold Block}}, the time taken for each bank upgrade to pay off is as follows. The first bank upgrade takes about {{Green|135}}  days to pay off; the second upgrade takes about {{Green|284}} days; the third takes upgrade {{Green|910}} days; and the final upgrade takes {{Green|846}} days to pay off (less than that of the third upgrade). Note no matter what upgrade the player has, once the player buys an upgrade, these will constantly be working towards making money back.
** Once the bank upgrade pays off, the player will start making a profit equal to the difference between the tier purchased and the previous tier every {{Green|31}} hours.
* As of [https://hypixel.net/threads/6132090/ Version 0.27], players can get up to {{Green|72%}} more interest through [[Museum Milestones]].

